WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.770
Networks do not always function perfectly.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:09.299
Things break, employees change their locations
and configurations, and software problems

00:00:09.299 --> 00:00:10.299
happen.

00:00:10.299 --> 00:00:15.270
As we cover troubleshooting in this domain,
try to focus on the process in which troubleshooting

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.230
takes place.

